Louisiana Lagniappe,Orange Beach,Cajun,"5-7pm; $5 wines.","Two Can Dine with a Bottle of Wine $59 (Sun-Thu); includes hushpuppies, salad, potato.","Entrees in special: Homemade hushpuppies, house salad, Creole stuffed or baked potato + choice of Jumbo Shrimp stuffed, Crescent City Fettucine, Large Fried Gulf Shrimp, Blackened Jumbo Shrimp with pineapple-rum butter, Chicken & Sausage jambalaya, Jumbo Gulf Shrimp & grits. Wine: Woodbridge Cabernet, Merlot, Red Blend, Chardonnay, Pinot Grigio, Sauvignon Blanc (upgrade +$10 for Clos du Bois, Twenty Acres, etc.).",,"Open 5pm nightly; upgrade options: Chargrilled Yellowfin Tuna +$6, Filet of Grouper, Grouper with toasted pecans, Chargrilled Ribeye +$10."\
Voyagers at Perdido Beach Resort,Orange Beach,"Fine Dining, Seafood/Steaks","None noted.","Chef's tasting menu (~$50); complimentary desserts for birthdays/anniversaries.","Starters: Wagyu Carpaccio ($18) \'96 Capers, crispy shallots, shaved parmesan, fresh horseradish, grain mustard aioli. Fried Green Tomato Stack ($15) \'96 Crab salad, spicy diablo sauce. Broiled Gulf Oysters Bienville/Rockefeller/Frenchie (varies). Steak Tartar & Marrow Bone ($25). Entrees: Perdido Stuffed Chicken ($32) \'96 Roasted tomatoes, spinach, fontina, bacon, purple sweet potato gnocchi. Seafood Pasta ($55) \'96 Scallops, shrimp, crab, cuttlefish ink tagliatelle. Furikake Grouper ($45) \'96 White miso butternut squash pur\'e9e. Roasted Gulf Whole Fish ($60). From the Broiler: Filet Mignon, Dry-Aged CAB Ribeye, Hanging Tenderloin, Tomahawk Duroc Pork Chop, Venison Chop (varies). Sides: Purple Sweet Potato Gnocchi ($9), Voyagers Baked Potato ($8), Crispy Brussels ($11). Desserts: 13 Layers of Chocolate - GF ($15), Peach Cheesecake ($15), Apple Bread Pudding ($14), Honey Cake ($14).",,"Gulf views; reservations recommended; 130+ wine selections."\
GTs On The Bay,Orange Beach,Seafood,"4-6pm daily; specials on drafts, house wines, apps (e.g., Firecracker Shrimp $10, Gingered Calamari $12, GTs Dip $11).","$10 Good Time Lunch (11 AM-4 PM): Fried Fish with Tots & Slaw, Shrimp Creole, etc.","Appetizers: Cajun Empanadas ($12) \'96 Crawfish, Conecuh, tasso ham, peppers, creole spices, remoulade. Crab Claws (fried, cocktail sauce). Lunch Entrees: Shrimp-n-Grits ($26) \'96 Gulf shrimp, Worcestershire, garlic, cream, Cajun spices, fried Parmesan grit cakes. Catch of the Day (grilled/blackened/fried, Parmesan grits, roasted vegetables). Fried Platters (shrimp, fish, etc.). Sides: Crushed Yukon Gold Potatoes ($4), Whipped Sweet Potato ($4). Desserts: Heath Bar Blondie, Double Chocolate Bread Pudding, Key Lime Pie, Fried Coconut Pies.",gtsonthebay.com/menu,"Waterfront; generous portions; salad bar add-on $6."\
Barometer Waterfront Grille,Orange Beach,"Tropical/Seafood","Wed-Fri 4-6pm; $3 drafts, $5 wells, complimentary Barometer bites (bar area).","New menu Jan 12 2026; plates starting $10; brunch & lunch 7 days.","Appetizers: Conch Fritters ($16) \'96 Caribbean conch, peppers, onions, spices, Caribbean sauce. Jerk Chicken Empanadas ($12) \'96 Shredded chicken, jerk spice, onion, bell pepper. Sandwiches: Blackened Fish Sandwich ($18) \'96 Redfish on Gambino roll, remoulade. Seared Ahi Tuna ($18) \'96 Blackening seasoning, lemon aioli, potato bun. Salads: Beach Body ($16) \'96 Greens, couscous, feta, pepitas, grilled chicken, raspberry vinaigrette. Entrees: Duck & Sausage Pasta ($22), Shrimp Scampi ($20), Admiral\'92s Filet ($52), Delmonico Ribeye ($48), Bone-In Pork Chop ($32), Grouper Filet ($33). Sides: Shaved Brussels, Asparagus, Dirty Rice, Steak Cut Fries, Horseradish Mashed Potatoes. Desserts: Bananas Foster Bread Pudding ($8), Key Lime Pie ($8).",,"Waterfront; groups 10+ subject to 20% gratuity; 3% credit card fee."\
Cosmo's Restaurant & Bar,Orange Beach,"Seafood, Eclectic","3-5pm or 4-6pm daily; $1 off drafts, house wines; $2 off sushi rolls; apps like Firecracker Shrimp ($10).","$10 Lunch Special (e.g., Fried Rice, Fried Catfish, Shrimp \'c9touff\'e9e).","Appetizers: Crab Claws (BBQ or fried). Savory Cheesecake (blue crab, bacon, spinach, Parmesan). Crab Cakes (lump crab). Lunch Salads: Sesame Seared Tuna, Caesar, Salmon Salad. Lunch Entrees: Fried Gulf Seafood, Fresh Catch (grilled/blackened/fried), Grilled Shrimp, Chicken Roulade. Noodles: Alfredo, Seafood Pasta, Lobster Andouille Mac-n-Cheese. Sandwiches: Poboy, Fish Sandwich, Hamburger, Crab Cake Sandwich. Pressing Matters: Cuban, Turkey and Havarti. Under Wraps: Cosmo's Club, Fish Taco Burrito, Black-n-Bleu Shrimp, Firecracker Chicken Wrap. $10 Lunch: Fried Rice, Fried Catfish, Fried Shrimp, Shrimp \'c9touff\'e9e, Tuna Poke Bowl.",cosmosrestaurantandbar.com/menu,"Off Canal Rd; dog-friendly patio; menu may not be fully up-to-date."\
